# DeepDose product shell (set in stone)

Product routes (`/real`, `/profile`, `/account`, `/connect`, `/chat`, `/dosage` and nested):

Copy the **OpenAI.com product formula** on **every** product page. Less is more.

**North star:** sleepmaxxing + daily Real (photo + SRI). Chemistry/dosage is secondary.

## Copy (mandatory)

- Every word must earn its place. No eyebrows, ledes, education blurbs, or labels that repeat what the UI already shows.
- No duplicate page titles in the body (title lives in `AppTopBar` only).
- No “Join” / “Open X” CTAs that duplicate bottom-nav destinations.
- Dial / score / % speak for themselves — do not caption them with SRI / chemistry / index waffle.
- Empty states: one short line + one action. No marketing paragraphs.

## Spacing (mandatory)

4px grid. Named roles only — never invent `0.35rem` gaps.

| Token | Value | Use |
|---|---|---|
| `--dd-inset` | 24px | Type ↔ tile edge |
| `--dd-inset-lg` | 32px | Hero tiles |
| `--dd-gap-tight` | 8px | Related lines |
| `--dd-gap` | 12px | Elements inside a tile |
| `--dd-stack` | 24px | Tile ↔ tile |

## Chrome & type

| Layer | Formula |
|---|---|
| Font | Inter only. Antialiased. **No Merriweather / display serif.** |
| Weight | **400** (name may use **300**). Active nav **500** max. |
| Title | `AppTopBar` — ~15px, weight 400. No spectrum. |
| Icons | Lucide, stroke ≤1.5, 20×20. |
| CTAs | Solid white or ghost. **No spectrum gradients.** |
| Tiles | Quiet borders; wash ≤8%. No hover jump. |

## Bottom nav

Real · Friends · Post · Chat · Profile. Chemistry is **not** a tab — reach it from Profile.

## Media / avatars

- No floating text pills on photos (“Add photo”, “Edit”, etc.).
- Whole control is the image; `aria-label` carries the action.
- Hover/focus: quiet overlay + icon only.

## Real (BeReal formula)

1. **Feed (`/real`):** cards = photo + SRI / Off / On + name + time.
2. **Post (`/real/post`):** one photo + today’s metrics → Post. One Real per day (overwrite OK).
3. Soft gate copy only if needed: “Post today’s Real to unlock the feed.”

## Profile header (Instagram formula)

1. **Header row:** compact avatar left + three metrics right (SRI / Off / On).
2. **Bio block:** name → location → journey, left-aligned under the header.
3. **Actions:** icon row under bio (Post Real, Friends), inside the identity tile.
4. **Content:** Your Reals grid; Chemistry is a quiet secondary link to `/dosage`.

## Actions

- Secondary functions use **`ProductIconAction`** — Lucide icons, `aria-label`, no visible text.
- Icon row lives **inside** the card (`.dd-icon-actions`), never floating between tiles.
- Do not invent orphan text links for Share / Friends / similar.

## Hard rules

1. **Use `ProductAppShell` only** for page chrome.
2. **Top:** `AppTopBar` — plain centered title, optional back / gear.
3. **Content:** one `seco-landing__section-inner` (`--page-max-app`).
4. **Bottom:** `AppBottomNav` — do not duplicate.
5. **Do not invent chrome, fonts, weights, gaps, gradient buttons, or filler copy.**
6. **Default post-auth landing:** `/real`.

## Out of scope

- Home splash `/`
- Marketing/policy pages (`/mission`, `/science`, `/terms`, …)
- Clinical/enterprise dashboards
